<title>USA: Salomon rumored to tap corp debt market.</title>
<headline>Salomon rumored to tap corp debt market.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Inc may tap the corporate bond primary market with its own $500 million debt offering as early as Tuesday, high-grade syndicate sources said.</p>
<p>The offering is expected to consist of a three-year maturity, sources said.</p>
<p>Unofficial price talk on the issue is 50 basis points over comparable U.S. Treasuries, they added.</p>
<p>(( -- Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675 ))</p>
</text>
